sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Workflow
  participant Tool
  participant Policy
  participant Accountant
  participant Audit
  Workflow->>Tool: Execute approved idempotent batch
  Tool->>Policy: Classified failure and checkpoint
  Policy->>Workflow: Transient and permitted: bounded automatic retry
  Workflow->>Tool: Reuse intent and idempotency key
  Policy->>Accountant: Consequential, unknown or exhausted: escalate
  Accountant->>Workflow: Review/approve remediation if permitted
  Workflow->>Audit: Record attempts, decisions and recovery evidence
